!**/.gitignore
!.git/HEAD
!.git/config
!.git/packed-refs
!.git/refs/heads/**

# Runtime and scratch directories that only ever exist in a dev environment.
# CI builds from a clean clone and never sees them, so their absence there
# hides the cost; in an environment where the daemon has run, `data/` grows
# with the model's memories. The image's only COPY is `publish`, so nothing
# below is ever read by the build.
/data
/tmp

# NOTE: do not add `publish/` here. `COPY publish app/` is the whole image.
